OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with attempted murder
OL,4,Aof taxi driver appears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared at Belfast
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court charged with the
OL,8,Fattempted murder of a taxi driver in
OL,9,Fwest Belfast in 2025.
OL,11,FJohn-Jo Lynch, 24, with an address at
OL,12,FSpringfield Road in Belfast, was also
OL,13,Fcharged with two counts of possession
OL,14,Fof a firearm and ammunition with intent
OL,15,Fto endanger life or cause serious
OL,16,Fdamage to property.
OL,18,FSean O'Reilly was shot twice as he sat
OL,19,Finside his car in the Bell Steel Manor
OL,20,Farea on 23 February 2025.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
